      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">&lt;div class=&quot;min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-12&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">        &lt;div class=&quot;max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">            &lt;div class=&quot;bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                &lt;div class=&quot;text-center mb-8&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h1 class=&quot;text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4&quot;&gt;Termos de Servi&#231;o&lt;/h1&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p class=&quot;text-gray-600&quot;&gt;&#218;ltima atualiza&#231;&#227;o: 28/06/2025&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                &lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                &lt;div class=&quot;prose max-w-none&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h2&gt;1. DEFINI&#199;&#213;ES E INTERPRETA&#199;&#195;O&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Para os fins destes Termos de Servi&#231;o, as seguintes defini&#231;&#245;es se aplicam:&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;AutoRecurso&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; ou &lt;strong&gt;&quot;n&#243;s&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: refere-se &#224; plataforma e servi&#231;os oferecidos&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Usu&#225;rio&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; ou &lt;strong&gt;&quot;voc&#234;&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: pessoa f&#237;sica que utiliza nossos servi&#231;os&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Plataforma&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: website e aplica&#231;&#245;es do AutoRecurso&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Servi&#231;os&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: gera&#231;&#227;o de recursos administrativos contra multas de tr&#226;nsito&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Recurso&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: documento legal gerado pela nossa IA para contesta&#231;&#227;o de multas&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Cr&#233;ditos&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: unidade de medida para utiliza&#231;&#227;o dos servi&#231;os&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;/ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h2&gt;2. ACEITA&#199;&#195;O DOS TERMOS&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Ao acessar e utilizar a plataforma AutoRecurso, voc&#234; concorda integralmente com estes Termos de Servi&#231;o e nossa Pol&#237;tica de Privacidade. Se voc&#234; n&#227;o concorda com qualquer parte destes termos, n&#227;o deve utilizar nossos servi&#231;os.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;div class=&quot;bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 my-6&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;div class=&quot;flex&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                            &lt;div class=&quot;flex-shrink-0&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                                &lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-yellow-400&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                            &lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                            &lt;div class=&quot;ml-3&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                                &lt;p class=&quot;text-yellow-700&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                                    &lt;strong&gt;Importante:&lt;/strong&gt; Estes termos constituem um acordo legalmente vinculativo entre voc&#234; e o AutoRecurso.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                                &lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                            &lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h2&gt;3. DESCRI&#199;&#195;O DOS SERVI&#199;OS&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h3&gt;3.1. Servi&#231;os Oferecidos&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;O AutoRecurso oferece:&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Gera&#231;&#227;o automatizada de recursos administrativos contra multas de tr&#226;nsito&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Utiliza&#231;&#227;o de m&#250;ltiplas tecnologias de Intelig&#234;ncia Artificial (GPT-4, Gemini, RoBERTa)&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Personaliza&#231;&#227;o de recursos com base nos dados fornecidos pelo usu&#225;rio&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Gera&#231;&#227;o de documentos em formato PDF prontos para protocolo&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Sistema de cr&#233;ditos para utiliza&#231;&#227;o dos servi&#231;os&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;/ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h3&gt;3.2. Limita&#231;&#245;es dos Servi&#231;os&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Nossos servi&#231;os s&#227;o limitados a:&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Gera&#231;&#227;o de recursos administrativos de primeira inst&#226;ncia&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Multas de tr&#226;nsito comuns (velocidade, estacionamento, sem&#225;foro, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Documentos baseados na legisla&#231;&#227;o brasileira de tr&#226;nsito&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;/ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h2&gt;4. CADASTRO E CONTA DO USU&#193;RIO&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h3&gt;4.1. Requisitos para Cadastro&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Para utilizar nossos servi&#231;os, voc&#234; deve:&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Ser maior de 18 anos&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Fornecer informa&#231;&#245;es verdadeiras, precisas e completas&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Manter suas informa&#231;&#245;es atualizadas&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Ser o propriet&#225;rio ou condutor autorizado do ve&#237;culo&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;/ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h3&gt;4.2. Responsabilidades do Usu&#225;rio&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Voc&#234; &#233; respons&#225;vel por:&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Manter a confidencialidade de sua senha&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Todas as atividades realizadas em sua conta&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Notificar imediatamente sobre uso n&#227;o autorizado&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                        &lt;li&gt;Fornecer dados precisos sobre a infra&#231;&#227;o&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;/ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    &lt;h2&gt;5. SISTEMA DE CR&#201;DITOS E PAGAMENTOS&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17892 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
